          "short": "$4\\frac{1}{5}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}5-a&=5-\\frac45\\\\5-a&=\\frac{25}{5}-\\frac45\\\\5-a&=\\frac{21}{5}\\\\5-a&=4\\frac15\\end{align*}$$",
