          "short": "$4\\frac{1}{20}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}6a-b&=6\\times\\frac45-\\frac34\\\\6a-b&=\\frac{24}{5}-\\frac34\\\\6a-b&=\\frac{96}{20}-\\frac{15}{20}\\\\6a-b&=\\frac{81}{20}\\\\6a-b&=4\\frac1{20}\\end{align*}$$",
